NOTICE

This repository preserves a small, abandoned digital artifact from April 2001: the in-browser Flash promo that warprecords.com served to announce Autechre's album "Confield" (Warp WARP CD 102, 2001-04-23). The artifact is no longer reachable from any active source on the open web. It is published here as a non-commercial act of digital preservation.

