WHAT IS LOST

The original promotional audio shipped with the Flash promo as two separate SWF files:

  http://www.warprecords.com/confield/audio1.swf
  http://www.warprecords.com/confield/audio2.swf

Neither file was ever successfully archived. The Wayback Machine's only captures of these URLs are HTTP 403 responses recorded on 2012-02-02 (see the Wayback CDX API for evidence). The released album track is used in video/confield_promo.mp4 as the closest available stand-in for the missing audio component, but it is not the original promo audio.

